  "label": "Concept of Grief and Loss",
  "description": "The meme relies on the universal human experience of grief and loss, particularly in the context of the death of a spouse and the birth of a child. This concept is not visually depicted but is essential to understanding the emotional weight of the text. The image of the man screaming in anguish is meant to symbolize this profound grief, which is a real-world emotional response to trauma.",
